{"id": "214577", "name": "נכון/לא נכון: הפרש קבוצות B∖A=B∩Aᶜ", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>לכל שתי קבוצות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span> מתקיים</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{{CT:0}} \\smallsetminus {{CT:1}} =B\\cap A^c\\]</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> כותבים את ההפרש לפי ההגדרה ומשווים לאגף ימין.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הפרש כחיתוך עם משלים</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\in B\\smallsetminus A\\)</span> אם ורק אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\in B\\)</span> וגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\notin A\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\in B\\)</span> וגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\in A^c\\)</span>. לכן לכל שתי קבוצות<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ B\\smallsetminus A=B\\cap A^c \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — בדיקת הטענה</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:2}}\"]]זו בדיוק הטענה, ולכן היא <b>נכונה</b>.[[else]]בטענה כתוב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\smallsetminus B\\)</span>, ששווה ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\cap B^c\\)</span>. דוגמה נגדית: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A=\\{1\\}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B=\\{2\\}\\)</span>. אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\smallsetminus B=\\{1\\}\\)</span> ואילו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\cap A^c=\\{2\\}\\)</span>. הטענה <b>אינה נכונה</b>.[[/if]]</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "boolean", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["s1", "s2", "ta", "tmp"], "nvariants": 2}